OL,3,AUS prosecutors reopen case of alleged
OL,4,Agang rape at Cornell University
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew York state prosecutors say they
OL,7,Fwill reopen a criminal inquiry into the
OL,8,Falleged rape of a woman at Cornell
OL,9,FUniversity in 2024.
OL,11,FThe woman filed a civil lawsuit on 16
OL,12,FSeptember alleging she was drugged and
OL,13,Fraped by multiple people at a
OL,14,Ffraternity house at the university.
OL,16,F"Once we determine the appropriate
OL,17,Fcharges, the case will be prosecuted in
OL,18,Fthe most objective and impartial means
OL,19,Fpossible" through a grand jury,
OL,20,FTompkins County District Attorney
OL,21,FMatthew Van Houten said Monday.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
