OL,3,AUS prosecutors reopen case of alleged
OL,4,Agang rape at Cornell University
OL,5,
OL,6,FCornell University said that while it
OL,7,Fsupported the case being brought before
OL,8,Fa grand jury, "any suggestion that the
OL,9,Funiversity did not impose consequential
OL,10,Fpunishments for those involved is
OL,11,Ffalse".
